{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-千川PC全域投放\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\"],\"capability_summary\":\"获取全域商家可选商品列表，适用于千川PC和随心商品投放全域场景。需要授权access_token，可根据多种条件筛选商品，并支持分页查询。配合接口有【获取Access token】。\",\"id\":\"qianchuan.product.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/product/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1825216221095947\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1825216221095947\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"全域商家可选商品列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1823275794887900%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1748264006369288%2C%22id%22%3A%22kYyh2%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-amki09FW\" id=\"h346b9f0-amki09FW\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-opRG4o4D\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/product/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/product/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1825216221095947\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-AB7YbPJT\" id=\"h346b9f0-AB7YbPJT\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-rks9kWAG\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-0Wqb0S5T\" id=\"h346b9f0-0Wqb0S5T\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-od2c453p\" id=\"h346b9f0-od2c453p\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iwpe89AX\">千川投放账户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">抖音号id<p data-id=\"p838747a-gqFgOFEf\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-bExAIxyx\">注意：针对无号商家，不需要入参；针对有号商家，必填</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-IjudgHTW\"></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">platfrom</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">下单平台 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-dW9iIq3Q\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QGNR931m\"><code>ECP_AWEME</code>：小店随心推</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4HB2i2Ng\"><code>QIANCHUAN</code>： 千川pc（默认） </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">is_overall_marketing</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-35gd9oizjzs000\">是否查询乘方数据，当在<span style=\"color: #323335;\">乘方创编场景中获取商品列表时需传入</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">过滤器</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">tab</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 商品分类tab，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-S4E0eZHJ\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-DXWlDQ2T\"><code>ALL</code> 全部</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9LRGfKbI\"><code>BREAKTHROUGH_PRODUCT</code> 破圈尖货</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-keo74dcR\"><code>GOOD_BOOST</code> 跑量优价</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-lPn20cRX\"><code>NEW_PRODUCT</code> 新品</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RT1injMK\"><code>SEARCH_TREND</code> 搜索趋势品</li></ul> 默认值: <code>ALL</code></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">create_roi2_limit_product</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\">只看未投放商品<p data-id=\"p838747a-9NWOax5Q\">注意：仅在tab为ALL和GOOD_BOOST时支持；如果已投放品超过3000，会导致过滤结果不准确</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">product_name</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jb8kIB6N\">根据商品名称搜索</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">product_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lx8xhFXT\">根据商品ID列表筛选，长度：<code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">1-50</span></code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filter_not_delivery_product</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4zobleh1z10000\">只看可投商品，当且仅当 is_overall_marketing=true 时支持传入</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_field</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">排序字段 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-GEJiL0PJ\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-l8NOm0YC\"><code>SELL_NUM</code> 销量</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2cC2PHl6\"><code>STOCK</code> 库存</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Z8cVa3N2\"><code>AUDIT_TIME</code> 上架时间</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-Y833RpOa\">注意：order_field参数仅在tab为ALL和GOOD_BOOST时支持</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">排序方式 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-nJTOdDBm\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-MKYJDrOp\"><code>ASC</code> 升序</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GPQQckkA\"><code>DESC</code> 降序</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-2AMobEDL\">注意：order_type参数仅在tab为ALL和GOOD_BOOST时支持</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">页码<p data-id=\"p838747a-ei3hj5wX\">注意：page传参仅在tab为ALL,SEARCH_TREND和GOOD_BOOST时支持</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Tat6pQBA\">页面大小，支持10、20、30</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">cursor</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">页码游标值<p data-id=\"p838747a-oOUOprrK\">注意：tab为ALL和GOOD_BOOST和SEARCH_TREND时不支持cursor模式</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-3Vm0Gyxh\" id=\"h346b9f0-3Vm0Gyxh\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv1.0%2Fqianchuan%2Funi_promotion%2Fproduct%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%